{"section":{"id":"cet4-2026-06-set2-news-report-2","examId":"cet4-2026-06-set2","title":"新闻 2","kind":"新闻","start":155.54,"end":216.59,"preview":"The navy rescued a man who survived 24 days floating in the sea on a boat by eating tomato sauce and vegetable powder.","lines":[{"start":155.54,"end":165.22,"text":"The navy rescued a man who survived 24 days floating in the sea on a boat by eating tomato sauce and vegetable powder."},{"start":165.22,"end":172.98,"text":"The man, 47, wrote the word HELP in English on the boat, which was key to his rescue."},{"start":172.98,"end":182.34,"text":"The man told authorities that his experience began in December when currents swept the sailboat out to sea while he was making repairs."},{"start":182.34,"end":186.26,"text":"To survive, the man collected rainwater with a cloth."},{"start":186.26,"end":191.06,"text":"He had to constantly remove water from the boat to prevent it from sinking."},{"start":191.06,"end":197.06,"text":"He also tried to light a fire to send a distress signal without success."},{"start":197.06,"end":201.38,"text":"Finally, a plane passed by and he signaled with a mirror."},{"start":201.38,"end":206.75,"text":"He said the navy told him that he was spotted when the plane passed again."},{"start":206.75,"end":212.18,"text":"The sailboat was abandoned at sea when the man was picked up by a nearby merchant ship."},{"start":212.18,"end":216.59,"text":"He was found in good health but had lost weight."}],"audio":"assets/audio/e343da6f2a98b9811a23e4996e579ed9bc26226f5ff2cd82e52f684c9d3d197f.wav","audioOffset":155.54},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"The navy rescued a man who survived 24 days floating in the sea on a boat by eating tomato sauce and vegetable powder.","start":155.54,"end":165.22,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"救援","icon":"life-buoy","image":"assets/images/0913d72452712a6b25ac0b9dcd2b4fc66df3d1c3127d216b943061f1a586e289.webp","alt":"海军救援船驶近漂流者"},"chunks":[{"text":